// Title: Availability % per VM from heartbeats
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: Heartbeat
// When to use: Monthly SLA reporting, or proving a VM was actually up during an incident window.
// Tune: Assumes 1 heartbeat per minute. Change the 7d window and 10080 (minutes in 7 days) together.

Heartbeat
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| summarize MinutesUp = dcount(bin(TimeGenerated, 1m)) by Computer
| extend AvailabilityPct = round(100.0 * MinutesUp / 10080, 2)
| order by AvailabilityPct asc
